  <p id="c-songshu-088-shenwenxiu:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-088-shenwenxiu:p001:m0000" ref="jyf_yg2_dqk_A">沈文秀</persName>字<persName id="c-songshu-088-shenwenxiu:p001:m0004" ref="jyf_yg2_dqk_A">仲遠</persName>，吳興武康人，司空<persName id="c-songshu-088-shenwenxiu:p001:m0015" ref="408_ce3_5d8">慶之</persName>弟子也。父<persName id="c-songshu-088-shenwenxiu:p001:m0022" ref="jyf_yg2_dqk">劭之</persName>，南中郎行參軍。</p>
